{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Roads Eye 可將手機化身為智能行車記錄儀，適合希望記錄行程、查看導航及整理影像的駕駛者；原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。此應用僅作駕駛輔助及記錄工具，使用時仍須專注路面並遵守交通法規。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-143.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>手機記錄行程與導航</h2>\n<p>應用可同時記錄路面、地圖及司機鏡頭，並以子母畫面呈現；支援事故記錄、實時導航及車內整合。行程歷史與已儲存錄像方便日後重看，亦可分享影像；內置散熱控制及手機溫度管理，有助長時間錄影時保持穩定，並提供個人化設定與分類儲存。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-121-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-122-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-123-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-124-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-125-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-126-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Roads Eye</li><li>應用類別：Navigation</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/roads-eye/id6762067121?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.277719+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":268,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T00:10:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T16:37:47.673470+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:04.636051+00:00","content_hash":"4b82911c49b7355aac36445e7957211809ccebd79e67d908302d4486b5e51627","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}